  giverName: "F\u0131r\u0131nc\u0131 Zehra"
  giverPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0366aa63b404f6742aec29adebb7f8d1, type: 3}
  giverLines:
  - "\xC7\u0131rak, f\u0131r\u0131nda gaz yan\u0131nca neler \xE7\u0131k\u0131yor?
    Usta bir keresinde s\xF6ylemi\u015Fti, unuttum."
  - "Bir de: ekmek kabar\u0131p k\u0131zar\u0131yor; bu da m\u0131 kimyasal? Kan\u0131t
    g\xF6ster."
  deliveryLines:
  - "Zehra'n\u0131n cevab\u0131 g\xFCvercinle geldi: \"Demek f\u0131r\u0131n\u0131m
    her sabah k\xFC\xE7\xFCk bir kimya dersi!\""
  hintText: "C<sub>3</sub>H<sub>8</sub> + 5O<sub>2</sub> \u2192 ? Tahtana bak."
